{"id":"0ce60c713fd9ffed","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-post-algebra.md","title":"Post Algebra","display":"df-post-algebra — Post Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-post-algebra","aliases":["93-df-post-algebra"],"display":"df-post-algebra — Post Algebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-lattice]]","[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-closure-operators]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-post-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-post-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-post-algebra — Post Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\\leq n\">\\(2\\leq n\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_n\">\\(P_n\\)</span> is the finite carrier defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_n\">\\(r_n\\)</span>, the chain order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_n\">\\(\\leq_n\\)</span>, its lattice operations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_n,\\vee_n\">\\(\\wedge_n,\\vee_n\\)</span>, and the cyclic operation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_n\">\\(c_n\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ZeroOp}_{93,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{ZeroOp}_{93,n}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OneOp}_{93,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{OneOp}_{93,n}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PostOpFam}_{93,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{PostOpFam}_{93,n}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_n\">\\(\\tau_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P_n\">\\(\\mathbf P_n\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,n}\\)</span> are defined here; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_n}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau_n}\">\\(\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau_n}\\)</span> have their source signatures.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>；原一元辅助函数仍以载集元素为自变量，运算族中的解释以单元组为自变量。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\nP_n\\coloneqq\\{j\\in\\omega:j&lt;n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\nP_n\\coloneqq\\{j\\in\\omega:j&lt;n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\nr_n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle j,\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&amp;j=0,\\\\\nn-j,&amp;0&lt;j&lt;n\n\\end{cases}\n\\right\\rangle:j\\in P_n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\nr_n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle j,\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&amp;j=0,\\\\\nn-j,&amp;0&lt;j&lt;n\n\\end{cases}\n\\right\\rangle:j\\in P_n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\leq_n\\;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in P_n^2:r_n(x)\\leq r_n(y)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\leq_n\\;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in P_n^2:r_n(x)\\leq r_n(y)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\wedge_n\\;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\nr_n^{-1}\\!\\bigl(\\min\\{r_n(x),r_n(y)\\}\\bigr)\n\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in P_n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\wedge_n\\;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\nr_n^{-1}\\!\\bigl(\\min\\{r_n(x),r_n(y)\\}\\bigr)\n\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in P_n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\vee_n\\;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\nr_n^{-1}\\!\\bigl(\\max\\{r_n(x),r_n(y)\\}\\bigr)\n\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in P_n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\vee_n\\;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\nr_n^{-1}\\!\\bigl(\\max\\{r_n(x),r_n(y)\\}\\bigr)\n\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in P_n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\nc_n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle j,\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;j=0,\\\\\nj+1,&amp;0&lt;j&lt;n-1,\\\\\n0,&amp;j=n-1\n\\end{cases}\n\\right\\rangle:j\\in P_n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\nc_n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle j,\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;j=0,\\\\\nj+1,&amp;0&lt;j&lt;n-1,\\\\\n0,&amp;j=n-1\n\\end{cases}\n\\right\\rangle:j\\in P_n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\nS_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\wedge,\\vee,{}&#39;,0,1\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\wedge,2\\rangle,\\langle\\vee,2\\rangle,\n\\langle{}&#39;,1\\rangle,\\langle0,0\\rangle,\\langle1,0\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\tau_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S_n,\\alpha_n\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ZeroOp}_{93,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,0\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{OneOp}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,1\\rangle\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\nS_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\wedge,\\vee,{}&#39;,0,1\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\wedge,2\\rangle,\\langle\\vee,2\\rangle,\n\\langle{}&#39;,1\\rangle,\\langle0,0\\rangle,\\langle1,0\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\tau_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S_n,\\alpha_n\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ZeroOp}_{93,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,0\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{OneOp}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,1\\rangle\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PostOpFam}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\wedge,\\wedge_n\\rangle,\n\\langle\\vee,\\vee_n\\rangle,\n\\langle{}&#39;,\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}(c_n;P_n)\\rangle,\n\\langle0,\\operatorname{ZeroOp}_{93,n}\\rangle,\n\\langle1,\\operatorname{OneOp}_{93,n}\\rangle\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PostOpFam}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\wedge,\\wedge_n\\rangle,\n\\langle\\vee,\\vee_n\\rangle,\n\\langle{}&#39;,\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}(c_n;P_n)\\rangle,\n\\langle0,\\operatorname{ZeroOp}_{93,n}\\rangle,\n\\langle1,\\operatorname{OneOp}_{93,n}\\rangle\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathbf P_n\\coloneqq\n\\langle P_n,\\operatorname{PostOpFam}_{93,n}\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathbf P_n\\coloneqq\n\\langle P_n,\\operatorname{PostOpFam}_{93,n}\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\nn\\in\\omega\\land2\\leq n\\to\\Bigl[{}&amp;\nr_n:P_n\\to P_n\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in P_n\\;(r_n(i)=r_n(j)\\to i=j)\n\\land r_n[P_n]=P_n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\leq_n\\;\\subseteq P_n^2\n\\land\\wedge_n,\\vee_n:P_n^2\\to P_n\n\\land c_n:P_n\\to P_n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ZeroOp}_{93,n},\\operatorname{OneOp}_{93,n}:P_n^0\\to P_n\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_n,\\alpha_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{PostOpFam}_{93,n}:S_n\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_n}(\\mathbf P_n)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\nn\\in\\omega\\land2\\leq n\\to\\Bigl[{}&amp;\nr_n:P_n\\to P_n\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in P_n\\;(r_n(i)=r_n(j)\\to i=j)\n\\land r_n[P_n]=P_n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\leq_n\\;\\subseteq P_n^2\n\\land\\wedge_n,\\vee_n:P_n^2\\to P_n\n\\land c_n:P_n\\to P_n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ZeroOp}_{93,n},\\operatorname{OneOp}_{93,n}:P_n^0\\to P_n\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_n,\\alpha_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{PostOpFam}_{93,n}:S_n\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_n}(\\mathbf P_n)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,n}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land2\\leq n\\land\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_n}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau_n}(\\{\\mathbf P_n\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,n}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land2\\leq n\\land\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_n}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau_n}(\\{\\mathbf P_n\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;_n n-1&lt;_n\\cdots&lt;_n2&lt;_n1\">\\(0&lt;_n n-1&lt;_n\\cdots&lt;_n2&lt;_n1\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_n\">\\(c_n\\)</span> is the displayed cycle. The permutation, order, lattice operations, cycle, two nullary operation graphs, operation family, and generator are explicit sets; no component is defined through the structure being constructed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-closure-operators]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}$ 来自 [[93-df-algebra]]；原一元辅助函数仍以载集元素为自变量，运算族中的解释以单元组为自变量。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex